seg-b52dd0dd550e = <b>Be honest about maturity.</b> The status registry is <c1/> — add or amend the row there, name its external oracle (or say plainly that there is none, which makes it <c2/>), then regenerate the published artifacts with <c3/>. <c4/>, <c5/> and <c6/> are all generated from that function and say "do not edit by hand" for a reason. Update the <c7/> narrative as well when the prose needs it, and label figures that are targets or ground- demonstrator results as such.

