seg-c3c260b7063e = Tests

# text
seg-34b9c8b6f70c = Test-driven: write the failing test first, with the expected value <b>derived by hand</b> from the physics/relation before implementing.

# text
seg-5322d5b2188c = Deterministic tests assert exact (hand-derived) values; statistical tests assert a stated tolerance and, ideally, average over seeds to control scatter.

