seg-776cd2ef0b0c = Export control

# text
seg-d0f1db9798a6 = PNT resilience and quantum sensing can touch dual-use export controls. Keep the public repository to generic, published models and methods. Anything resembling export-sensitive resilience/anti-spoof depth belongs in the private overlay, not here. If unsure, ask before contributing it.

